<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Galásia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galásia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galásia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Paulo nia surat</para>
  <para style="mt2">ba sarani sira iha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Galásia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Paulo hahuu nia surat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1-2" />Hau Paulo, ho maluk sarani sira hotu nebee hamutuk ho hau, haruka surat nee ba sarani sira iha fat-fatin iha provinsia Galásia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:1-2">Hau sai apostolu laos tanba ema kriatura ruma mak hili, maibee Jesus Kristu ho Aman Maromak mak foo knaar nee mai hau. Kristu nee mak Salvador nebee Maromak promete hori uluk kedas atu haruka mai. Nia mate tiha, maibee Aman Maromak halo Nia moris fali ona.<verse eid="GAL 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Ami harohan ba ita nia Aman Maromak ho Nai Jesus Kristu para hatudu Sira nia laran diak ba imi, i foo pas ho hakmatek ba imi. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kristu foo Aan ba mate hodi hamoos ita nia sala i hasai ita husi buat aat iha mundu nee. Nia halo nunee tuir ita nia Aman Maromak nia hakarak. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Mai hahii adora Maromak too tinan ba tinan nafatin! Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nusaa mak imi tuir fali hanorin nebee la loos?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Hau admira! Nusaa mak bele sai nunee?! Maromak bolu ona imi atu hatene Nia laran diak. Maibee imi fila kotuk lalais deit ba Nia hodi tuir fali hanorin seluk <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />nebee la loos. Tuir lo-loos, Kristu nia Liafuan Diak ida deit, la iha tan seluk. Maibee agora iha ema balu mai bobar fali Liafuan Diak nee tuun-sae, halo imi la hatene atu tuir dalan ida nebee.<verse eid="GAL 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Kuidadu! See-see deit mak hanorin la hanesan ho Liafuan Diak nebee uluk ami hanorin ba imi, husik malisan kona nia ba! Maski ami rasik ka, anju husi lalehan mos, malisan sei kona. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ami hatete tiha ona, agora hau repete dala ida tan: Se iha ema ruma hanorin fali oin seluk, la tuir Liafuan Diak nebee uluk imi simu tiha ona nee, Maromak sei kastigu nia tinan ba tinan nafatin.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Hau koalia hanesan nee atu ema bele gaba hau ka? Lae! Hau hakarak atu halo haksolok Maromak nia laran, laos atu halo haksolok ema nia laran. Se hau buka atu ema gaba hau karik, entaun hau la serve sai Kristu nia atan.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus Kristu rasik mak hili Paulo hodi lori Liafuan Diak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Maun-alin sira, hau foo hatene lo-loos ba imi katak, Liafuan Diak nebee hau hanorin nee, laos inventa. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Hau laos simu husi ema, laos ema mak hanorin hau, maibee Jesus Kristu rasik mak hatudu mai hau.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Imi rona ona kona ba hau nia moris uluk, bainhira hau sei tuir relijiaun Judeu nian. Iha tempu nebaa hau halo Maromak nia povu terus liu, i hakaas aan para halo rahun sira.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 8:3</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Hau foo neon ho laran tomak hodi estuda relijiaun Judeu nian i halo tuir, liu fali ema Judeu sira seluk nebee idade hanesan hau. Hau badinas liu halo tuir ita nia bei-ala sira nia lisan ho lei relijiaun hotu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 22:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15-16" />Maski nunee Maromak desidi atu hatudu Nia Oan Jesus mai hau. Bainhira hau sei iha hau nia inan nia kabun laran, Nia hatudu ona Nia laran diak mai hau hodi hili hau atu baa foo sai Liafuan Diak kona ba Jesus ba ema nebee laos Judeu. Bainhira Nia hatudu Nia Oan mai hau, hau la baa husu ema seluk nia hanoin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 9:3-6</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Hau mos la baa iha sidade Jerusalém atu hasoru malu ho apostolu sira seluk nebee Jesus foti uluk ona. Maibee hau baa kedas iha rai Arabi. Hotu tiha hau fila fali mai iha sidade Damasku.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Liu tiha tinan tolu foin hau baa iha Jerusalém hodi hasoru malu ho Pedro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paulo temi Pedro nia naran “Cefas”. Nee Pedro nia naran ho lian Aram.</char></note> I hau hela ho nia durante loron sanulu resin lima.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 9:26-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Iha momentu nebaa hau mos hasoru Nai Jesus nia alin, Tiago. Maibee hau la haree apostolu sira seluk. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Buat nebee hau hakerek nee, loos duni. Maromak hatene hau la bosok.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Depois hau baa iha provinsia Síria ho Silísia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Iha tempu nebaa Kristu nia povu iha fat-fatin iha provinsia Judeia seidauk konhese hau. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Sira rona deit ema konta dehan, “Ema ida nebee uluk halo terus ita nee mak agora foo sai fali Liafuan Diak kona ba Kristu. Afinal uluk nia obriga ita atu fila kotuk ba Kristu.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />I sira hahii Maromak tanba Maromak muda ona hau nia moris.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Apostolu sira seluk simu Paulo nia hanorin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Liu tiha tinan sanulu resin haat, hau baa fali Jerusalém, hamutuk ho Barnabé. Ami lori mos Tito.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 11:30</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Hau baa tanba Maromak mak haruka. Iha nebaa hau hasoru malu ho nai ulun sarani sira hodi konta fali ba sira Liafuan Diak nebee mak durante nee hau foo sai ba ema nebee laos Judeu. Hau koalia ho nai ulun sira deit, atu sira bele tetu di-diak hau nia hanorin nee loos ka lae. Tanba hau lakohi para servisu nebee hau halao nee saugati deit.<verse eid="GAL 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Nai ulun sira simu hau nia liafuan ho diak. Sira simu mos Tito. Maski nia ema Gregu, laos ema Judeu, maibee sira la obriga nia atu sunat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ema Judeu sira halo serimonia sunat ba labarik mane hotu-hotu bainhira sira halo loron walu. Nee sinal ida hodi hatudu katak labarik nee Maromak nian, i tama ona ba Maromak nia povu.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Iha duni ema balu hakarak obriga nia para sunat tuir ema Judeu sira nia lei relijiaun. Ema sira nee finji fiar ba Jesus hodi tama iha sarani sira nia leet. Kristu Jesus foo ona liberdade mai ita, maibee ema sira nee hakarak hadau fali liberdade nee hodi halo ita sai atan fali ba lei relijiaun Judeu nian. Nee mak sira atu obriga Tito para sunat. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Maski nunee ami nunka halo tuir, para imi bele fiar nafatin Liafuan Diak nebee imi simu husi ami, tanba Liafuan nee mak loos.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Nai ulun sira nee hanesan ema boot iha sarani sira nia oin. Maibee mai hau, atu boot ka kiik, hau la interese, tanba Maromak la haree ba ida nee. Bainhira hau hatoo hau nia hanorin ba sira, sira simu ho diak i la aumenta liafuan ida.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deuteronómiu 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Laos nee deit, sira mos rekonhese katak Maromak foo fiar ona mai hau para foo sai Liafuan Diak ba ema nebee laos Judeu, hanesan mos Nia foo fiar ba Pedro lori Liafuan Diak ba ema Judeu. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Sira haree katak Maromak foo kbiit ba Pedro hodi halao nia servisu nudar apostolu ba ema Judeu. Nunee mos Nia foo kbiit mai hau nudar apostolu ba ema nebee laos Judeu. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Tiago, Pedro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paulo temi Pedro nia naran “Cefas”. Nee Pedro nia naran ho lian Aram. Nunee mos iha versikulu 11 ho 14.</char></note> ho João rekonhese katak, Maromak foo ona knaar nee mai hau. Sira nain tolu nee, sarani sira respeita nudar ulun boot igreja nian. Sira kaer liman ho hau ho Barnabé hanesan sinal katak ami hotu laran ida. Sira konkorda para ami lori nafatin Liafuan Diak ba ema nebee laos Judeu, i sira mak lori ba ema Judeu. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />So buat ida deit mak sira husu mai ami, atu ami tulun ema kiak sira iha Jerusalém. I hau mos hakarak duni halo nunee.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo siak Pedro tanba haketak aan husi ema nebee laos Judeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Depois iha loron ida, Pedro mai iha sidade Antiokia, hau siak nia iha sarani sira nia oin tanba nia hahalok la loos. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Bainhira Pedro foin too mai, nia kontenti haan hamutuk ho sarani sira nebee laos Judeu. Maibee kuandu Tiago nia kolega sira too mai, Pedro haketak aan tiha husi sarani sira nebee laos Judeu. Nia tauk nia maluk Judeu sira nee, tanba sira hanorin dehan sarani sira hotu tenki sunat tuir lei relijiaun Judeu nian.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iha nee Paulo bolu Tiago nia kolega sira nee “grupu sunat nian”. Ema sira nee hanorin dehan, sarani sira tenki sunat tuir lei relijiaun Judeu nian i tenki kaer metin lei nee tomak. Sira mos hanorin dehan, ema Judeu la bele haan hamutuk ho ema nebee laos Judeu.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Ema Judeu sira seluk mos komesa halo tuir Pedro nia hahalok finjidu nee, too Barnabé mos halo tuir i lakohi haan tan ho ema nebee laos Judeu.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Hau haree sira nia hahalok nee la tuir lia loos nebee mak Liafuan Diak hanorin. Nunee hau siak Pedro iha sira hotu nia oin dehan, “Irmaun moris mai ema Judeu. Maibee irmaun rasik la moris ona tuir lei relijiaun Judeu nian. Entaun nusaa mak agora ita hakarak obriga ema nebee laos Judeu atu sira tuir fali lei nee hotu?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Loos duni, ami moris mai ema Judeu nanis, ami laos sala nain hanesan ema nebee laos Judeu. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Maibee agora ami hatene katak, la iha ema ida mak Maromak simu tanba nia tuir lei relijiaun. Maromak simu ema tanba fiar ba Jesus Kristu. Nee mak ami mos fiar ba Kristu, para Maromak bele simu ami tanba ami nia fiar, laos tanba ami tuir lei relijiaun.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Salmu 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Roma 3:20</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 3:22">22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ami fiar katak Maromak simu ami tanba ami laran ida ho Kristu. Maibee too ikus ema Judeu balu foo sala mai ami dehan, ami halo sala tanba la tuir ona lei relijiaun. Se nunee, Kristu mak halo ami sala ka? Lae liu! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Hau husik tiha ona sistema lei relijiaun nian, hau la bele kaer fali. Se hau kaer fali, nee hau sala. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Uluk hau hakaas aan halo tuir lei relijiaun, maibee lei nee la bele halo hau diak malu ho Maromak. Agora kona ba lei nee, hau hanesan mate tiha ona, para hau bele foo hau nia moris tomak ba Maromak. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Bele dehan, hanesan hau mate tiha ona iha krus hamutuk ho Kristu. Agora laos hau mak moris tan, maibee Kristu mak moris iha hau. Durante hau moris iha mundu nee, hau laran metin deit ba Maromak nia Oan. Nia hadomi teb-tebes hau, too foo nia Aan hodi mate iha hau nia fatin. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Maromak simu hau tanba Nia laran diak. Hau lakohi fila kotuk ba Nia laran diak nee. Tanba se karik Maromak simu ita tanba ita halo tuir lei relijiaun, entaun nee dehan katak, Kristu nia mate la iha folin.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Nai Maromak simu ita tanba ita fiar ba Jesus Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Imi ema Galásia, imi beik-teen liu! Keta ema lohi imi karik! Uluk hau foo hatene mo-moos tiha ona ba imi kona ba Jesus Kristu nia mate iha krus. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Agora hataan took mai. Tanba saa mak Maromak foo Nia Espiritu ba imi? Nia foo tanba imi tuir lei relijiaun ka? Lae! Nia Espiritu tuun ba iha imi tanba imi fiar Liafuan Diak nebee imi rona ona. <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Entaun nusaa mak imi beik demais nunee?! Fo-foun imi moris tuir Espiritu Santu. Maibee agora imi hakarak lao too rohan ho imi nia kbiit rasik. <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Imi hetan terus barak ona tanba imi fiar ba Kristu. Keta halo be imi nia terus nee hotu sai saugati deit. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Maromak foo Nia Espiritu ba imi, i halo milagre iha imi nia leet. Imi hanoin Nia halo nunee tanba imi halo tuir lei relijiaun ka? Lae! Nia halo nunee, tanba imi fiar ba Liafuan Diak nebee imi rona tiha ona.<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Hanoin took ema Judeu sira nia bei-ala Abraão. Iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, “Nia fiar ba Maromak, nee mak Maromak hamoos nia sala hodi simu nia.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Jénesis 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Roma 4:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Imi tenki kompriende di-diak buat nee: Ema nebee fiar ba Maromak, nia mak sai hanesan Abraão nia oan. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Livru Sagradu foo hatene nanis ona dehan, Maromak sei simu mos ema nebee laos Judeu, naran katak sira fiar ba Nia. Tanba hori uluk kedas Nia hatete ona Liafuan Diak ba Abraão dehan, “Ema iha nasaun hotu-hotu sei hetan bensaun tanba o.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Jénesis 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Nee duni Maromak foo bensaun ba ema hotu nebee fiar ba Nia, hanesan mos Nia foo ba Abraão tanba nia fiar.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ema nebee fiar aan katak Maromak sei simu nia tanba deit nia moris tuir lei relijiaun, ema nee hetan malisan. Tanba iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, “Ema nebee mak la kumpri hotu lei relijiaun, nia hetan malisan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Deuteronómiu 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />La iha ema ida mak bele kumpri lei nee tomak. Nunee la iha ema ida mak Maromak simu tanba nia moris tuir lei relijiaun. Nee klaru! Tanba hakerek ona dehan, “Ema tenki fiar ba Maromak mak foin Maromak simu nia hodi foo moris rohan-laek ba nia.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Habakuk 2:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Maibee lei la haree ba fiar, lei haree deit, ita kumpri tomak ka lae. Tanba iha lei nee hakerek dehan, “Ema nebee mak halo tuir buat sira nee tomak, nia sei hetan moris.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Levítiku 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Maibee Kristu foo nia Aan hodi hasai ita husi lei relijiaun nia okos, para lei nee la bele lori malisan mai ita. Hanesan nee Nia rasik simu fali ita nia malisan. Tanba iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, “Ema nebee mate iha ai riin, nia hetan malisan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Deuteronómiu 21:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Kristu Jesus foo liberdade mai ita para bensaun nebee Maromak uluk foo ba Abraão, tuun mos ba ema nebee laos Judeu. Nunee se ita fiar ba Kristu, ita bele simu Maromak nia Espiritu nebee Nia promete tiha ona.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Maromak kaer metin Nia promesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Maun-alin sira, agora hau hakarak foo ezemplu husi ita nia moris loro-loron. Se ema nain rua hakerek surat akordu ida, depois sira asina tiha, surat nee vale ona. Ema ida la bele kansela, i la bele aumenta tan liafuan ruma ba iha surat nee. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Nunee mos bainhira Maromak halo promesa ba Abraão ho nia jerasaun. Iha momentu nebaa Maromak dehan, “Hau halo promesa nee ho o nia jerasaun ida.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iha nee Paulo hakerek dehan, Maromak halo promesa ho Abraão nia “fini”. Nee dehan katak, nia jerasaun. Haree mos iha Jénesis 12:7.</char></note> Nia laos dehan, “o nia jerasaun sira”, tanba Nia la foo promesa nee ba ema barak. Maibee Nia foo ba Abraão nia Jerasaun ida, nee mak Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Buat nebee hau hakarak hatete mak nee: Maromak halo promesa uluk ho Abraão. Liu tiha tinan atus haat tolu-nulu foin Nia hatuun lei relijiaun. Maibee lei nee laos troka Maromak nia promesa ida uluk nee, promesa nee lao nafatin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Ézodu 12:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Se karik Maromak foo bensaun ba ita tanba ita tuir lei relijiaun, entaun ita la simu ona bensaun tuir Maromak nia promesa. Maibee laos hanesan nee! Maromak hatudu Nia laran diak hodi foo bensaun ba Abraão tanba Nia promete tiha ona atu foo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Roma 4:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Entaun Maromak foo lei relijiaun atu halo saida? Nia foo lei relijiaun hodi hanorin katak, ita ema nee sala nain. Nia hakarak atu lei nee vale too deit Abraão nia Jerasaun ida nebee temi iha promesa nee too mai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 3:19">Bainhira Maromak foo lei relijiaun ba ema Judeu sira, Nia foo ba anju sira mak entrega fali ba Moisés para foo tutan ba povu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Maibee bainhira Nia halo promesa ho Abraão, Nia foo laos liu husi ema seluk. Maromak rasik mak koalia.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lei relijiaun hanorin kona ba ema nia sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Karik imi hanoin katak, lei relijiaun kontra fali Maromak nia promesa. Lae liu! Se karik lei nee bele lori ita ba moris rohan-laek, entaun ita tuir lei, ita diak malu ho Maromak. Maibee la bele duni, <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />tanba iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, sala kesi metin ema hotu-hotu iha mundu. Nee duni so ema nebee fiar ba Jesus Kristu deit mak bele simu buat nebee mak Maromak promete tiha ona.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Uluk, Jesus Kristu seidauk mai, lei relijiaun kesi metin hela ami ema Judeu. Ami hanesan fali dadur too Maromak foo sai katak ema tenki fiar ba Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Nunee lei relijiaun eduka ami too Kristu mai, para ami bele diak malu fali ho Maromak liu husi ami nia fiar ba Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Agora ami fiar ona ba Kristu, ami laos iha lei relijiaun nia okos ona.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema nebee fiar ba Kristu sai Maromak nia oan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Agora imi hotu-hotu sai ona Maromak nia oan, tanba imi fiar ba Kristu Jesus. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Imi simu ona batizmu atu sai ida deit ho Kristu, i agora imi moris tuir Nia ezemplu, bele dehan hanesan imi falun aan ho Kristu nia hahalok. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Imi hotu-hotu nebee fiar ba Kristu Jesus sai ona ida. Nunee, atu imi ema Judeu ka laos ema Judeu, atan ka laos atan, mane ka feto, hanesan deit.<verse eid="GAL 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Imi Kristu nia ema. Nunee imi mos sai ona Abraão nia jerasaun, i bensaun nebee mak Maromak promete ba Abraão, imi mos sei simu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Roma 4:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Hau foo ezemplu ida tan. Bainhira aman ida mate, nia oan iha direitu atu simu nia riku-soin. Maibee se nia oan nee tinan seidauk too, nia sei hanesan atan. Maski riku-soin hotu-hotu aban-bainrua sai ninian, <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />maibee ema seluk mak tau matan ba nia ho nia sasaan sira nee too tempu nebee mak nia aman desidi tiha ona.<verse eid="GAL 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Uluk Jesus seidauk mai, ita mos hanesan labarik nee. Ita sei hakruuk ba lisan mundu nee nian, hanesan atan. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Maibee too nia tempu, Maromak haruka Nia Oan mai. Maromak nia Oan nee moris husi feto ida, i moris iha lei relijiaun nia okos. <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />Nia mai atu foo liberdade ba ema hotu-hotu nebee moris iha lei relijiaun nia okos, para ita mos bele sai Maromak nia oan.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Imi sai ona Maromak nia oan. Tanba nee mak Maromak mos haruka Nia Oan nia Espiritu mai tama iha ita nia laran. I Espiritu iha ita nee halo ita brani bolu Maromak, “hau nia Aman doben.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Entaun agora imi laos atan ona, maibee imi sai ona Maromak nia oan. Tanba imi sai Nia oan mak imi iha direitu simu riku-soin hotu-hotu nebee Nia promete ona ba Nia oan sira.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Roma 8:15-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo preokupa ho sarani sira iha Galásia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Uluk bainhira imi seidauk konhese Maromak, imi sai atan hodi adora buat nebee laos Maromak. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Maibee agora, imi konhese ona Maromak. Tuir loos hau dehan, Maromak mak konhese imi. Entaun nusaa mak imi hakarak fila fali baa tuir lisan mundu nian, maski lisan nee fraku, i la bele salva imi? Imi hakarak hakruuk fali ba buat sira nee hodi sai fali atan ka? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Hau rona dehan, imi halao serimonia tuir loron, fulan, loron boot ho tinan, ho objetivu atu Maromak simu imi. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Nee halo hau hanoin barak! Keta halo be hau hanorin imi durante nee, saugati deit.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Maun-alin sira, hau husu boot atu imi livre husi buat sira nee, hanesan mos hau. Tanba hau moris livre ona husi lei relijiaun Judeu, hanesan mos imi nebee laos ema Judeu. Uluk, bainhira ita sei hamutuk, imi la halo buat aat ida mai hau. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Imi hotu hatene, fo-foun hau baa foo sai Liafuan Diak ba imi, hau hamutuk ho imi tanba hau nia saude laduun diak. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Maski hau nia kondisaun nee foo todan ba imi, maibee imi la hakribi hau. Imi simu hau hanesan fali Maromak nia anju ida. I liu tan, imi simu hau hanesan imi simu Kristu Jesus rasik. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Iha tempu nebaa imi hotu haksolok teb-tebes. Nusaa mak agora imi la haksolok tan? Hau hatene, iha momentu nebaa imi hadomi teb-tebes hau, too imi prontu hasai imi nia matan fuan atu foo mai hau. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Maibee agora imi konsidera hau hanesan fali imi nia inimigu tanba hau koalia ba imi buat nebee mak loos ka?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Ema lohi door sira nee hakaas aan dada imi para tuir sira, laos atu halo diak ba imi. Sira hakarak halo imi dook tiha husi ami hodi tuir fali sira ho laran tomak. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Imi halo buat ruma ho laran tomak, nee diak, maibee imi tenki iha objetivu nebee mak diak. Entaun, atu hau hamutuk ho imi ka dook husi imi mos, hakaas aan halo nafatin buat nebee mak diak.<verse eid="GAL 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Hau nia oan doben sira, agora hau esforsu aan ho terus ba imi dala ida tan, hanesan feto nebee kanotak moras atu tuur ahi. I hau sei esforsu aan nafatin, too imi nia laran sai hanesan Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Maibee agora, hau la hatene atu halo saida tan. Tuir loos hau hakarak atu baa koalia rasik ho imi, atu hau la bele koalia makaas hanesan nee.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komparasaun kona ba Hagar ho Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Se imi hakarak hakruuk ba ema Judeu sira nia lei relijiaun karik, diak liu imi kompriende lai, lei nee dehan saida loos. <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, Abraão iha oan mane nain rua, ida husi nia atan feto Hagar, ida husi nia kaben Sara nebee ema livre.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Jénesis 16:15</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Nia atan nee hetan oan tanba ema kriatura nia hakarak. Maibee nia kaben nebee livre nee hetan oan tanba Maromak promete ona nunee.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Feto nain rua nee, ita bele kompara ho promesa rua nebee Maromak halo ho ema. Promesa ida, Nia halo ho Moisés iha foho Sinai, bainhira Nia hatuun lei relijiaun ba ema Judeu sira. Ema sira nebee moris iha lei nia okos, sira mos sai atan hanesan Hagar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Nunee Hagar kompara ho foho Sinai iha rai Arabi. I nia mos bele kompara ho ema Jerusalém nebee agora dadauk moris hanesan atan iha lei nee nia okos.<verse eid="GAL 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Maibee ita nebee fiar ba Kristu, ita laos atan ona, ita livre hanesan ita nia inan Sara. Nunee ita nia sidade mak Jerusalém foun iha lalehan. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kona ba Sara ho Jerusalém foun, iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Feto nebee nunka iha oan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">haksolok ona ba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Feto nebee nunka senti kanotak moras atu tuur ahi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">haklalak ona ba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Feto nebee nia laen husik hela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">sei hetan oan barak liu fali feto nebee mak iha laen.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isaias 54:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Maun-alin sira, imi sai ona Maromak nia oan, tanba Maromak mak promete nunee. Entaun imi hanesan Sara nia oan Isac, tanba nia mos moris mai tuir Maromak nia promesa. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Iha tempu nebaa Abraão nia oan nebee moris mai tanba ema nia hakarak, bainhira boot ona, nia halo terus fali Isac, maski Isac nee moris mai tanba Maromak nia Espiritu nia hakarak. Agora dadauk mos ema nebee moris iha lei nia okos halo terus ema nebee moris livre.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Jénesis 21:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Maibee iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, “Duni sai tiha atan feto nee ho nia oan. Tanba atan nia oan la iha direitu simu nia aman nia riku-soin. So oan husi nia kaben nebee livre mak iha direitu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Jénesis 21:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Entaun, maun-alin sira, ita laos atan nee nia oan, maibee ita hanesan oan husi Abraão nia kaben nebee livre.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Kaer metin liberdade nebee Kristu foo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kristu hasai ona ita husi lei relijiaun nia okos, atu nunee ita bele moris livre. Neebee kaer metin imi nia liberdade nee, i keta husik ema halo imi sai atan fali.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Rona mai! Hau Paulo mak koalia. Se imi simu sunat para bele diak malu ho Maromak, entaun Kristu nia mate la iha folin ba imi. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Hau hatete dala ida tan: See mak simu sunat tuir ema Judeu nia lei relijiaun, nia mos tenki halo tuir lei nee tomak. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ema nebee hakaas aan moris tuir lei para Maromak bele simu nia, ema nee moris haketak aan husi Kristu, nia fila kotuk ba Maromak nia laran diak. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Maibee Maromak nia Espiritu halo ita laran metin katak, Maromak sei simu ita tanba ita fiar ba Kristu. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Nunee, se ita laran ida ho Kristu Jesus, ita sunat ka la sunat, nee la iha buat ida. Importante mak nee: Ita fiar ba Kristu, i hatudu fiar nee liu husi hadomi ema seluk.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Fo-foun imi moris tuir Kristu ho lo-loos. See mak bosok imi hodi sees fali husi dalan loos nee? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Lia bosok nebee imi rona nee, laos mai husi Maromak. Tanba Nia mak bolu imi sai Nia oan. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Ema dehan, “Fermentu uitoan tau ba trigu halo masa tomak sae.” Nunee mos hanorin falsu, maski uitoan deit, bele lori ema barak ba dalan sala.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 Korintu 5:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Bele nunee mos, hau laran metin ba Nai Jesus katak, imi sei la tuir sira nia hanorin falsu nee. I see-see deit mak halo imi konfuzaun, Maromak sei kastigu.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Maun-alin sira, se karik hau hanorin nafatin katak, ema tenki sunat, entaun nusaa mak ema Judeu halo terus hau? Se nunee, hau nia hanorin kona ba Jesus nia mate iha krus, la halo sira hirus. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Maibee ema nebee halo imi sai konfuzaun kona ba sunat, husik ba, sira halo liu tan too sira rasik kapa sira nia aan ba!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Maun-alin sira, Maromak bolu ona imi para sai ema nebee livre. Maibee la bele uza imi nia liberdade nee atu halo saida deit tuir imi nia hakarak rasik. Imi tenki hadomi malu hodi serbi malu. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Lei tomak nia huun mak ukun fuan ida nee: “O tenki hadomi o nia maluk hanesan o hadomi o nia aan rasik.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levítiku 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Maibee se imi lees malu i haan malu hela deit mak imi sei haree. Imi sei rahun hotu.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moris tuir Espiritu Santu, laos tuir ita ema nia hakarak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Buat nebee hau atu hatete ba imi mak nee: Imi tenki moris tuir Espiritu Santu nia hakarak. Se imi moris nunee, entaun imi sei la halo buat aat tuir imi nia hakarak rasik. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Tanba ita ema nia hakarak la haan malu ho Espiritu nia hakarak. I Espiritu nia hakarak la haan malu ho ita ema nia hakarak. Buat rua nee kontra malu. Tanba nee mak buat nebee imi hakarak halo, imi la bele halo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Roma 7:15-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Maibee se Espiritu Santu mak imi nia matadalan, imi la moris tan iha lei relijiaun nia okos.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Imi hatene mo-moos ona, ema nebee halo aat tuir sira nia hakarak, sira nia hahalok oinsaa. Por ezemplu, halo sala seksual ho sala foer oi-oin too la hatene moe, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />adora lulik, kaer ai kulit aat, odi malu, istori malu, kaan ema nia sasaan, nervozu aat, buka diak deit ba nia aan rasik, forma grupu keta-ketak hodi la simu malu, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />laran moras ema, lanu-teen, festa too halo arbiru tuun-sae, i buat aat sel-seluk tan. Uluk hau foo hatene tiha ona ba imi, agora hau foo hanoin dala ida tan: Ema sira nebee moris hanesan nee, sira sei la tama iha Maromak nia reinu.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Maibee se ita moris tuir Espiritu Santu nia hakarak mak Nia halo ita sai ema nebee hatene hadomi, laran haksolok, pas, pasiensia, laran diak, tulun ema, halo tuir buat nebee ita promete, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />laran maus, i domina aan. La iha lei ida mak bandu hahalok sira nee. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />See mak sai ona Kristu Jesus nia ema, nia la moris tan tuir nia hakarak nebee aat. Tanba hakarak aat ho hanoin aat hotu-hotu, nia prega tiha ona iha krus. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Espiritu Santu foo ona moris foun mai ita, nunee ita tenki moris tuir Nia hakarak. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Ita la bele foti aan, la bele sadik malu, i la bele laran moras ba malu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Tulun malu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Maun-alin sira, se ema sarani ida monu ona ba sala, entaun imi nebee mak moris tuir Espiritu Santu nia hakarak, tenki baa koalia di-diak ho nia hodi lori nia fila fali ba dalan loos. Maibee kuidadu imi nia aan, para la bele monu tuir nia. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Se imi ruma hetan susar, imi tenki ajuda malu, i nunee imi halo tuir Kristu nia lei. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Se ema ruma hanoin dehan, nia diak liu ema seluk, afinal lae, nia bosok nia aan. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Neebee ema ida-idak tenki haree ba nia hahalok rasik. Se diak karik, kontenti ba. Maibee la bele kompara ho buat nebee ema seluk halo. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Tanba ema ida-idak tenki responsabiliza ba nia aan rasik.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Ema nebee hanorin Maromak nia liafuan ba imi, keta haluha suporta nia ho buat nebee imi iha.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Keta bosok imi nia aan dehan Maromak la hatene buat nebee mak imi halo. Tanba buat nebee ema kuda agora, ida nee mak aban-bainrua nia sei kuu. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Nunee mos, buat nebee nia halo agora, aban-bainrua nia sei simu nia rezultadu. See mak halo aat tuir nia hakarak rasik, nia sei rahun. Maibee see mak moris tuir Maromak nia Espiritu nia hakarak, nia sei simu moris rohan-laek husi Espiritu nee. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Nee duni la bele baruk halo buat nebee diak. Tanba too iha nia loron, ita sei simu rezultadu diak, naran katak ita halo diak nafatin. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Nunee, bainhira ita hetan oportunidade atu ajuda ema seluk, halo deit ba. Saa tan ita nia maluk sira nebee fiar ba Kristu.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo taka nia surat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Haree ba! Liafuan sira nee, hau rasik mak hakerek ho letra bo-boot.<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Ema sira nebee hatudu aan iha ema Judeu sira nia oin, sira nee hakarak obriga imi atu sunat. Afinal sira halo nunee so atu ema Judeu la bele halo terus sira. Tanba se sira laran metin deit ba Kristu nia mate iha krus, entaun ema Judeu sei halo terus sira. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Maski sira sunat ona mos, sira rasik la tuir lei relijiaun tomak. Maibee sira hakarak atu imi sunat para sira bele gaba aan dehan, imi halo tuir ona lei nee.<verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Maibee ba hau, hau lakohi gaba buat ida, hau so gaba deit kona ba ita nia Nai Jesus Kristu nia mate iha krus. Tanba Nia mate iha krus mak buat mundu nian la iha tan folin mai hau. I tuir ema mundu nia hanoin, hau mos hanesan mate tiha ona. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Atu sunat ka la sunat, nee la importante. Importante mak Maromak halo foun ona ita nia moris. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Ema hotu-hotu nebee tuir hanorin nee, sira sai ona Maromak nia povu lo-loos. Maromak mos sei hatudu Nia laran luak ba sira i foo pas ho hakmatek ba sira.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Hau lakohi para ema halo tan problema ho hau. Tanba fitar sira iha hau nia isin nee hatudu katak hau serbi Jesus.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Maun-alin sira, hau harohan atu ita nia Nai Jesus Kristu hatudu Nia laran diak ba imi hotu. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>